IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DENOMINATION-CALC.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-WITHDRAW-AMT PIC 9(6).
01 WS-500-COUNT PIC 9(3).
01 WS-200-COUNT PIC 9(3).
01 WS-100-COUNT PIC 9(3).
01 WS-REMAINING PIC 9(6).
01 WS-TOTAL-NOTES PIC 9(3).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
DISPLAY "ENTER YOUR WITHDRAW AMOUNT -> ".
ACCEPT WS-WITHDRAW-AMT.

DIVIDE 500 INTO WS-WITHDRAW-AMT GIVING WS-500-COUNT REMAINDER WS-REMAINING.
DISPLAY "500 COUNT -> " WS-500-COUNT.

DIVIDE 200 INTO WS-REMAINING GIVING WS-200-COUNT REMAINDER WS-REMAINING.
DISPLAY "200 COUNT -> " WS-200-COUNT.

DIVIDE 100 INTO WS-REMAINING GIVING WS-100-COUNT REMAINDER WS-REMAINING.
DISPLAY "100 COUNT -> " WS-100-COUNT.

COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-NOTES = WS-500-COUNT + WS-200-COUNT + WS-100-COUNT.
DISPLAY "TOTAL NOTES IN YOUR WITHDRAWAL AMOUNT : " WS-TOTAL-NOTES.


STOP RUN.